      "prime": true,
      "description": "Celebrate the countdown to Christmas with the LEGO City Advent Calendar 2026 (60510) building toy for kids ages 5 years old and up. The 2026 edition of this Christmas advent calendar is packed with 24 days of seasonal surprises, including mini builds and characters that bring a daily dose of delight and inspire creative play. Kids will discover several minifigures as they open the calendar, including Santa, Mrs. Claus, 3 elves and a snowman, plus a baby reindeer figure. This advent calendar for kids also contains buildable toys like a rocking horse and choo-choo train, plus fun North Pole accessories like carrot noses for snowmen (or reindeer snacks) and a cup of hot chocolate. What better place to put together builds than the place where the Christmas magic happens: Santa’s workshop! Kids can fold out the playmat on the box to reveal a Santa’s workshop scene. It’s the perfect place for aspiring elves to make (and play with) the toys they find each day in the calendar. This LEGO advent calendar makes a great pre-Christmas gift for boys, girls and anyone who loves celebrating the countdown to Christmas. Each surprise toy comes with easy step-by-step building instructions printed on the inside of its calendar window, so even new LEGO builders can enjoy a fun build-and-play experience. Kids can also combine the buildable toys, accessories and minifigures included in the LEGO City Advent Calendar 2026 with other playsets (each sold separately) from the LEGO City collection. Contains 252 pieces."
